Package: kulan-fleet-admin
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Maintainer: @PUBLISHER@ <@MAINTAINER_EMAIL@>
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Depends: python3 (>= 3.11), python3-cryptography, python3-gi, python3-gi-cairo, gir1.2-pango-1.0, gir1.2-gtk-4.0, gir1.2-adw-1 (>= 1.5), gir1.2-secret-1, openssl | whois, qrencode
Recommends: kulan-desktop-settings
Homepage: @HOME_URL@
Description: @NAME@ fleet dashboard for administrators
 Kulan Fleet shows the computers in your organisation with their updates,
 compliance and encryption, and lets admins ask them to install updates,
 lock, restart, switch off or go into lost mode. It also manages people's
 accounts, groups and policies, Google Workspace mailboxes, remote help,
 a weekly security report and the activity log.
 .
 Only Kulan Fleet admins can use it. Not installed by default.
